## Evidence rules

- Start every evidence item as `pending`.
- Record the exact command, environment, source revision, result, and retained artifact.
- Keep synthetic proof distinct from live customer-system proof.
- A stale log does not prove a dirty or newer working tree.
- Do not infer production effectiveness from compilation, mocked calls, or documentation alone.
- Redact secrets and customer-sensitive data without removing the facts needed to audit the result.

